樂真實身分曝？胡錫進揭「與中國沒半毛錢關係」：太小看黃仁勳</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.034020+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1571,"images":19,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:00:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T16:37:44.590286+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:59.584275+00:00","content_hash":"112a176ccaf21d0a63d37b9d1ca064d1c951bfd165b7906977806f2ac4ec8e17","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}